; vishesa: particular — what distinguishes one instance from another.
; "this ball's mass = 5kg" is vishesa of the samanya "mass".
; the rashi instance IS vishesa; the kosha concept IS samanya.
; already used as edge type (vishesa-yukta) throughout the graph.

(sangati vishesa
  (amsha padartha)
  (pratipaksha samanya)
  (siddha pratyaksha))
